{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Cave Exit</strong> is a challenging top-down action dungeon crawler with light roguelike elements and procedurally generated floors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal: <strong>Find the exit on each floor</strong>, collect gems and loot, solve small puzzles, and defeat monsters standing in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress by upgrading your character, completing floors across multiple levels, and ultimately defeating <strong>5 powerful bosses</strong>. Your journey leads you to uncover the <strong>Gem of Protection</strong> \u2014 but getting there won\u2019t be easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080880/extras/207d6c110e7e224e649b8fdaac7912b8.avif?t=1762782958\" width=640 height=128 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to be completed in <strong>3 to 8 hours</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging but fair difficulty</strong> \u2013 gets easier as you grind and upgrade</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay is <strong>repetitive yet rewarding</strong>, with short loops and long-term progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is <strong>simple but precise</strong>, requiring timing and basic tactics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080880/extras/8bf2562b4e763068ae6d7e56609636c7.avif?t=1762782958\" width=640 height=64 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features &amp; Content</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 Levels</strong> with <strong>80 floors</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>hand-crafted map parts</strong> assembled in random layouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>23 enemy types</strong>, each with unique behavior</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 challenging bosses</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2 puzzle types</strong> with many variations:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 Ice Light Puzzles (with a pool of 21 variations)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 Mirror Puzzles (with a pool of 74 variations)</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dozens of collectible items</strong>, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 lamps (30 variations)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >19 rock types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 collectible gems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 pickaxes (11 variations)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 rings (8 variations)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 melee weapons (50 variations)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 throwing weapons (19 variations)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080880/extras/d3335c307e3817e41dbe695658415082.avif?t=1762782958\" width=640 height=128 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Risk &amp; Reward</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision matters:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lose all items</strong> collected on a run unless you consume hazelnuts or almonds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lose some gems</strong> upon defeat \u2013 gems are needed for upgrades and item purchases.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must weigh your options:<br>Do you <strong>return to invest</strong> what you\u2019ve gained, or <strong>descend deeper</strong> for greater rewards?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level consists of <strong>8 floors</strong>. At the end of each, a <strong>boss or quest item</strong> awaits. Completing it unlocks the next level \u2013 and new challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Epilepsy Warning</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning:</strong> This game contains visual effects such as flashing lights, patterns, or animations that may trigger seizures or loss of consciousness in individuals with photosensitive epilepsy. Please play only if you feel well, and consult a medical professional if you are unsure.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4080880?t=1762782958","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4080880?t=1762782958","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080880/afc214c18c41df1e75dc9117338a8f2d495dc815/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762782958","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080880/afc214c18c41df1e75dc9117338a8f2d495dc815/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762782958","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4136510,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Cave Exit</strong> is a challenging top-down action dungeon crawler with light roguelike elements and procedurally generated floors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal: <strong>Find the exit on each floor</strong>, collect gems and loot, solve small puzzles, and defeat monsters standing in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress by upgrading your characte